"""Generated by Rumoca - SymPy view of `TwinDriveShaft` from the checked DAE IR.

Mirrors the `lean-dae` target: `EQUATIONS[k]` is the k-th conjunct of the Lean
`Equations` definition (a structured family is a list of `Eq`, one per binder
value), `PARAM_BINDINGS` is `Params.Bound`, `INITIAL` is `Initial`.

Symbols: `P`, `U`, `X`, `DX`, `Y` map Modelica names to SymPy symbols for
parameters/constants, inputs, states, state derivatives (`der_<name>`), and
algebraics/outputs. Arrays are column `Matrix`es (rank 1) or matrices (rank 2)
of symbols named `<name>[i]` / `<name>[i,j]` (Modelica 1-based). Real literals
are exact `Rational`s read from their decimal text.
"""

